      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of the \"Quick Start\" guide for the SkyLink CLI:\n\n**Quick Start for SkyLink CLI**\n\nGet your development environment up and running in under 5 minutes!\n\nTo start using SkyLink CLI, make sure you have:\n\n1. **Docker installed**: Ensure that Docker is running on your machine.\n2. **Node.js v18+ installed**: Verify that you have Node.js version 18 or higher installed.\n\nNext, install the SkyLink CLI globally using npm:\n```bash\nnpm install -g skylink-cli\n```\nFollow these steps to authenticate and start using SkyLink CLI:\n\n1. **Login to SkyLink**: Run `skylink login` to authenticate with your SkyLink account.\n2. **Deploy to Staging**: Use `skylink deploy --env staging` to deploy your application to the staging environment.",
      "source": "target",
